sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User
  participant PGM as /programme-manager
  participant PM as /project-manager
  participant DEV as /developer
  participant GH as GitHub

  U->>PGM: implement issue #N
  PGM->>GH: list prior sprint PRs
  alt any prior PR still open
    PGM-->>U: ❌ REFUSE · SD-007
  else all prior merged
    PGM->>GH: check cross-repo DEP-NNN
    alt upstream not merged
      PGM-->>U: ❌ REFUSE · cross-repo
    else cleared
      PGM->>PM: dispatch (SD-007 preamble)
      PM->>DEV: invoke /developer for #N
      DEV->>GH: re-verify (belt & braces)
      alt gate now trips
        DEV-->>PM: 🛑 HARD BLOCK
      else cleared
        DEV->>DEV: TDD → gates → review → handover → PR
      end
    end
  end
